OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry around dawn but
OL,6,FStorm Boelo will soon arrive to bring
OL,7,Frain and strengthening winds. A breezy
OL,8,Fmorning with spots of rain will become
OL,9,Fmore unpleasant in the afternoon with
OL,10,Fpersistent heavy rain, strong winds
OL,11,Fand coastal gales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBecoming dry with clear
OL,14,Fspells in the evening but winds will
OL,15,Fcontinue to strengthen to bring
OL,16,Fwidespread gales inland overnight.
OL,17,FSome showers are possible after dusk,
OL,18,Fmainly in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
