OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells, but very strong and
OL,7,Fpotentially disruptive winds will
OL,8,Fcontinue throughout the day. Scattered
OL,9,Fshowers in the north but should remain
OL,10,Fdry further south.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOn
OL,13,FMonday, heavy rain will pass followed
OL,14,Fby strong winds with coastal gales.
OL,15,FBrighter on Tuesday, with scattered
OL,16,Fshowers and gales. On Wednesday, sunny
OL,17,Fspells, showers and breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
